  _title: "Parque Tecnol\xF3gico de Exporta\xE7\xE3o"
  _titleEn: Export Technology Park
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Parques tecnol\xF3gicos concentram empresas de software e servi\xE7os,
    com incentivos e universidades por perto."
  _summaryEn: Technology parks concentrate software and service companies, with incentives
    and universities nearby.
  _realWorld: "O Porto Digital foi fundado em 2000 no bairro do Recife Antigo para
    reter profissionais qualificados e revitalizar o centro hist\xF3rico."
  _realWorldEn: Porto Digital was founded in 2000 in Recife's historic port district
    to retain skilled professionals and revitalize the old center.
  _tradeOffs: "Incentivos fiscais t\xEAm custo, e a valoriza\xE7\xE3o do entorno
    pode expulsar moradores antigos."
  _tradeOffsEn: Tax incentives have a cost, and rising nearby values can push out
    long-time residents.
